WEBVTT

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:32.682
But there was still another dream
that she wanted to get back to.

00:19:32.706 --> 00:19:34.246
After her legs were amputated,

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.866
Felicia thought she would
never play volleyball again.

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.756
Then a friend suggested
she try sitting volleyball,

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.706
an adapted version for players
with different abilities.

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:45.207
FS: It felt so amazing.

00:19:45.231 --> 00:19:46.467
It felt like I was home.

00:19:46.491 --> 00:19:48.846
Like this is where I was meant to be.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:52.555
AG: Felicia decided to try out
for the Canadian national team,

00:19:52.579 --> 00:19:53.738
and she made it.

00:19:53.762 --> 00:19:57.746
(Cheers)

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:58.929
FS: We got a bronze,

00:19:58.953 --> 00:20:01.303
and we qualified
for the Paralympics in Rio.